solution.p:
The opposite action to multiplication is division:
\begin{gathered}
{18Q}\gt{90}\\
\divideunder{{18Q}}{18}\gt\divideunder{{90}}{18}\\
Q \gt 5
\end{gathered}
So in set-builder notation, the solution set is {\{ Q \mid Q > 5 \}}\text{.}

